---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How this website uses cookies and similar technologies, and how analytics are configured."
  path="/cookies"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Cookie Policy</p>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p>This site uses Google Analytics 4, provided by Google, to understand how the site is used (for example which pages are visited and which calls to action are clicked). This page is a placeholder structure pending legal review.</p>
      <h2>Analytics cookies</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics sets first-party cookies (typically named <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_&lt;ID&gt;</code>) that distinguish visitors and sessions. They are used for aggregated measurement only. Advertising features and ad personalization are disabled.</p>
      <p>For visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, analytics storage is denied by default: no analytics cookies are set, and Google receives only limited, cookieless signals. For visitors elsewhere, analytics cookies are allowed by default.</p>
      <h2>Essential cookies</h2>
      <p>This marketing site does not set any other cookies of its own.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install Google's opt-out browser add-on. Blocking analytics does not affect your ability to use this site.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
